From d8689812189636d7e647697d232b9ea668716cbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWE13 Recomp <wwe13-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:06:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] apple: macOS / iOS (Apple silicon) platform port

Build: Apple platform (macos-arm64 / ios-arm64), AppleClang 16+, no
-mcmodel, -force_load for the kernel archive, no librt, lower-case arm64
processor name, @loader_path rpaths, _XOPEN_SOURCE + _DARWIN_C_SOURCE on
rexcore (PUBLIC) for <ucontext.h>.

UI: SDL3 window backend (window_sdl, windowed_app_context_sdl,
windowed_app_main_sdl) with a CAMetalLayer; MetalLayerSurface and
VK_EXT_metal_surface so MoltenVK presents to it. SDL3 video/metal/haptic/
sensor enabled on Apple only.

Core: Darwin signal context (__ss/__ns/__es) in the exception handler and
SIGBUS handled like SIGSEGV (Darwin raises SIGBUS for protection faults);
Mach semaphores for thread suspend (no sem_init on Darwin), SIGUSR1/2
instead of real-time signals, pthread_threadid_np, Darwin thread names, no
affinity or SCHED_FIFO; mach_vm_region instead of /proc/self/maps,
MAP_FIXED_NOREPLACE emulation, short shm_open names; _NSGetExecutablePath;
fibers on Darwin ucontext; freeze logger without /proc on Apple.

Linux and Windows code paths are unchanged.
